{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On Sunday, April 20, 2025, the sixth card pack <strong>&quot;FuwaFuwaMagicalStage&quot;</strong> will be added to <strong>&quot;VTBattle: It's Not About Subscribers, It's About Power!&quot;</strong>, now available on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This update introduces <strong>35 new VTubers</strong>, bringing the total to <strong>210 playable characters</strong>\u2014and maybe even a few hidden ones?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Highlights of the 6th Update]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">35 new VTubers join the battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brand-new status effect: <strong>Poison</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">31 new unique skills added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustments to some characters' stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buffs to select existing skills</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose Your Favorite VTuber from Over 200 Characters!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 VTubers\u2014ranging from game streamers and singers to ASMR creators and illustrators\u2014have joined the fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every single one of them is fully playable as your main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2024-12-18_155133.png?t=1745074866\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Robust Collection Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the 100+ VTubers has unique cards of varying rarities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect all the cards of your favorite VTubers and complete your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Gameplay System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This title combines elements of card games, auto-battles, and roguelites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will assemble a set of five cards, enhancing their stats such as HP, ATK, DEF, MAG, MDEF, and SPD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat rivals, obtain stronger cards, and face ever-tougher opponents in your journey to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2024-12-18_154936.png?t=1745074866\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Every Card Has a Role!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The power of a card depends not on its character but on its level and rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards of the same character can be leveled up, and higher rarities grant additional skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This system ensures that every card can shine in battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Estimated Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1-2 hours to complete a run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monetization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game permits monetization during live streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revenue generation through video-sharing sites and live-streaming platforms is also allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Streaming Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may stream all scenes of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional Notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game can be freely featured in live streams as long as it is within standard usage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, please remember that this title features numerous VTubers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We kindly ask that you show respect to all featured performers.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"EASY CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/df1b8059b2696d0d02ddc879b981f0e43cdb7f32.jpg"},{"name":"NORMAL CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/f5fd8a86f6ae29b11a772cb22a6411062bad3a1d.jpg"},{"name":"HARD CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/e61b4ac90eac31d9bd1d2c7ca25699edc53b3405.jpg"},{"name":"NORMAL TRUE END","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/3d6161ceeb5d60617077e3d4f5d063e8343c5b9c.jpg"},{"name":"HARD TRUE END","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/d12f0e3a7c81e24c13d6b9c990260436a0219bf9.jpg"},{"name":"UR Get","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/7b72edb7b908e462e668229b1f9c73754dfa6adb.jpg"},{"name":"NORMAL 30 consecutive wins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/2822b23534d16537a60e55bf66e69535454b4be1.jpg"},{"name":"HARD 30 consecutive wins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/cb2d16ba3c9b2dbd9bab3a96a56c63570b592c9e.jpg"},{"name":"CardPack ArenaGenesis Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/5f3f38d3437a769e2d111bf91ff797980894db83.jpg"},{"name":"CarcPack Rock'n Rose Diva Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/bb01fee66582ec08f2b58e2c6bbed2322884ba4d.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3139930?t=1745074866","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3139930?t=1745074866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/a71badb9ffc03375808b6182315c3eddfa794411/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745074866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/a71badb9ffc03375808b6182315c3eddfa794411/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745074866","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game contains illustrations with a high level of exposure."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On Sunday, April 20, 2025, the sixth card pack <strong>&quot;FuwaFuwaMagicalStage&quot;</strong> will be added to <strong>&quot;VTBattle: It's Not About Subscribers, It's About Power!&quot;</strong>, now available on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This update introduces <strong>35 new VTubers</strong>, bringing the total to <strong>210 playable characters</strong>\u2014and maybe even a few hidden ones?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Highlights of the 6th Update]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">35 new VTubers join the battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brand-new status effect: <strong>Poison</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">31 new unique skills added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustments to some characters' stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buffs to select existing skills</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose Your Favorite VTuber from Over 200 Characters!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 VTubers\u2014ranging from game streamers and singers to ASMR creators and illustrators\u2014have joined the fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every single one of them is fully playable as your main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2024-12-18_155133.png?t=1745074866\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Robust Collection Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the 100+ VTubers has unique cards of varying rarities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect all the cards of your favorite VTubers and complete your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Gameplay System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This title combines elements of card games, auto-battles, and roguelites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will assemble a set of five cards, enhancing their stats such as HP, ATK, DEF, MAG, MDEF, and SPD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat rivals, obtain stronger cards, and face ever-tougher opponents in your journey to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2024-12-18_154936.png?t=1745074866\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Every Card Has a Role!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The power of a card depends not on its character but on its level and rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards of the same character can be leveled up, and higher rarities grant additional skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This system ensures that every card can shine in battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Estimated Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1-2 hours to complete a run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monetization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game permits monetization during live streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revenue generation through video-sharing sites and live-streaming platforms is also allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Streaming Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may stream all scenes of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional Notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game can be freely featured in live streams as long as it is within standard usage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, please remember that this title features numerous VTubers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We kindly ask that you show respect to all featured performers.</p>","developers":["Wataritama"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akama